---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { brand } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Contact & Feedback" description={`Share feedback about ${brand.name} or report an issue. Learn what details help troubleshoot without sending private photos or facial measurements.`} breadcrumb="Contact"><div class="page-head"><span class="eyebrow">CONTACT AND FEEDBACK</span><h1>Feedback is welcome.</h1><p>Found a rough edge or have an idea? A clear description helps improve the experience.</p></div><article class="article-layout">{brand.contactEmail ? <><h2>Email {brand.name}</h2><p><a href={`mailto:${brand.contactEmail}`}>{brand.contactEmail}</a></p><p>This opens your email app. There is no contact form service and no photo attachment is added.</p></> : <div class="notice"><strong>Preview contact:</strong> Send feedback to the project owner through the conversation where this preview was shared. A public support email has not been configured for this preview.</div>}<h2>What to include</h2><ul><li>Your browser and operating system.</li><li>The page and action that produced the issue.</li><li>The error message, if one appeared.</li><li>What you expected to happen.</li></ul><p>Please do not send face photos, landmark data or private reports. We cannot retrieve your analysis because it is never uploaded.</p><h2>Need a quick answer?</h2><p>The <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> covers photo quality, camera permissions and saving reports. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains how local processing works.</p></article></Base>
